  "reuse": [
    "Find Potion5004-case proof already covers shared start33 softness/selection gates. Find Item now supplies saved noselect metadata, source corpse access and start-payment wiring; Grim Ward must separately model nodraw while preserving approved retained-loot access.",
    "Reuse native persistent missile/ground-state scheduling and source direction/geometry helpers where actual routes agree. Grim Ward is not a summoned monster in reviewed do75.",
    "Current do14 dispatches function30, the shared generic curse handler, every6 remaining-frame multiples. Reuse ordinary curse/stat/AI consumers after tracing the missile anchor and modern stat evaluation; do not assume ideal periodic area or Howl cast origin."
  ],
  "findings": [
    "Pinned start33/do75 costs4mana at successful start, uses an eligible soft corpse and requests free coordinates with collision mask0x1000/radius2. Source small/large flags choose one of three start missiles; small Range5 versus medium/large8 matters before the active ward starts.",
    "Do75 requests missile creation, then toggles both corpse_nodraw and corpse_noselect and refreshes the source corpse. Source factory failure return is not checked here; geometry/record guards occur earlier. Do not reuse Find Item reservation alone as the full ward lifecycle.",
    "Hit26 creates the active child with range override max(calc1,5); current calc1=1000 frames. Body missile nominal Range200 is not the skill-created lifetime. Start/body/stop/scare paths remain distinct.",
    "Body do14 uses max(missile Param1,1)=6 and tests remainingFrames modulo that period before dispatching Param2=30. Source dispatch table30 is SKILLS_SrvDo030_Curse; it is not a30-projectile emission count. First pulse depends on the remaining-frame phase.",
    "Pinned curse has terror state, ln12 radius6+(rank-1),60-frame base lease, negative dm78 movement/attack/other-animation rates and physical resistance -20-5*hard Find Potion. Generic curse source divides AI-curse duration by difficulty and reads aura stat fields. Missile/owner hard-synergy context and modern behavior need proof.",
    "Scare missile/hit28 exist separately: it resolves a parent missile by targetX, uses strict parent-centered squared range and applies a rank1 Terror helper. Its active use by the current do30 route is not established; do not substitute this older path silently."
  ],
  "nextSteps": [
    "Compile bounded start/do75 guards, size selection, factory/toggle order, hit26 child lifetime and do14 modulo/dispatch contracts with pinned modern data.",
    "Trace/compile generic curse callback allocation, target/AI immunities, Attract and duration/refresh semantics plus ground-missile anchor/owner/gear/hard-synergy context.",
    "Implement persistent start/body/stop phases and source centered aura through existing scheduling/stat/fear consumers; preserve original corpse contents and record any unsupported branch.",
    "Verify4mana start cost, size-dependent activation, first-pulse phase/refresh/range/expiry and overlapping wards, slow/resistance pools, owner transitions and two reloads."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Reviewed immutable source hashes and current pinned tables only. No new handler, runtime change or class completion is claimed by this preflight.",
    "Published primary historical guidance is supplementary; current skill has additional slow/physical-resistance fields. General DM reference conflict stays open; keep current native curve meanwhile.",
    "Final three-size GrimWard start/body/stop art, cry, affected-state cues and talent/hotkey icons remain separate future assets."
  ]
